id: pm-vcs-p7resolve
title: Resolve conflicts and propagate resolutions through automatic descendant rebase
description: Extend explicit tip resolution to selected ancestor changes and automatically replay every descendant with stable change ids and FileIds. Tip resolution is included in the first slice; ancestor propagation follows here.
type: Feature
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-18T03:01:41.313Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-22T11:57:22.208Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-21T18:55:29.652Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-21T18:55:29.652Z"
author: codex-agent
estimated_minutes: 720
acceptance_criteria: "resolve supports path, field and ours/theirs/base/value; ancestor resolution replays descendants across branches/tags atomically; unrelated edits survive and stable change ids persist; new conflicts remain recorded with complete sides and verification passes."
parent: pm-vcs-phase7
resolution: Delivered by the audit-linked mainline implementation.
expected_result: Resolve conflicts and propagate resolutions through automatic descendant rebase.
actual_result: "Re-verified unchanged main 27e1d84671fa: delivery 7609e6c61980 remains in main ancestry; engine/repo.ts, engine/rewrite.ts, test/resolution-propagation.test.ts remain present."
